001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TRPTDUIN.
001300 AUTHOR.              ANDREW T LEPERA.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        FEB 1,1980.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.             THIS PROGRAM PRINTS A REPORT OF ITEMS
001900*                     TO BE INVENTORIED AS OF THE REPORT DATE.
002000*
002100*    ON W 2/17/81, THE FOLLOWING CHANGES WERE MADE:
002200*    1.  STOREROOM CLASS WILL BE PRINTED OUT FOR THE REPORT
002300*        ONLY IF UNION CITY.
002400*    2.  PHYSICAL INVENTORY CYCLE WILL BE PRINTED OUT IF OTHER
002500*        THAN 180 DAYS.
    00*    3.  DUE TO BE INVENTORIED DATE WILL BE CALCULATED CORRECTLY
002700*        FOR ANY CYCLE, FROM 0 - 9999, INSTEAD OF ONLY BEING
002800*        CORRECT FOR INV CYCLE LESS THAN 2 YEARS.
002900*
003000*    ON JULY 12, 1982 THE BUFFER AREA MSTORERM WAS CHANGED
003100*    IN PREPARATION FOR THE NEW DATA BASE CHANGES. B.J.P.
003200*
003300*    ON SEPTEMBER 7, THE PROGRAM WAS CHANGED TO EXCLUDE ALL
003400*    CODES THAT HAVE '9999' ENTERED AS THEIR PHYSICAL INVENTORY
003500*    CYCLE, AND A HEADER PAGE WAS ADDED TO THE PROGRAM. BJP.
003600*
003700*    ON NOVEMBER 26, MADE CORRECTIONS TO HEADER PAGE. BJP.
003800*
003900*    ON JULY 24, 1984;                 -B. WINTER
004000*       1.  IF THE STOREROOM ONHAND IS ZERO, INSTEAD OF PRINTING
004100*           THAT CODE AUTOMATICALLY ON THE REPORT, IT IS NOW PRINTED
004200*           ONLY IF THE LAST INVENTORIED DATE IS OLDER THAN 60 DAYS.
004300*       2.  ADDED 60 DAYS TO THE TABLE OF COMMON INVENTORY CYCLES.
004400*       3.  ADDED THIRD REASON IN REPORT HEADER FOR NOT PRINTING
004500*           ITEMS.
004600*       4.  ELIMINATED AND CLEANED UP ABOUT HALF OF PRINT CODE
004700*           THAT WAS NOT NEEDED.
004800*
004900*
005000*    ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
005100*    MAY 18, 1985.    V.W.D.
005200*
005300*    THE FOLLOWING HAS BEEN ADDED:
005400*     -TRSCREEN FOR FRONT END REPORT OPTIONS
005500*     -ADDED HEADER PAGE TO THE REPORT USING SUPROGRAM THDPRT2
005600*     -PRINT COMPRESSION FEATURE
005700*     -NON-HP LOGIC
005800*     -CHANGED TO USE COPYLIB FOR ALL DATA SET BUFFER DESC.
005900*     -CHANGED COPY STATEMENTS TO "IN COPYCSIS".
006000*      JAN 5,1987.  C.J.R.
006100*
006200*
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  06/13/96        JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   CHANGED CALLS TO JULIAN AND GREGDATE TO USE
      *C   NEW SUBROUTINE JULGREG TO USE CENTURY IN CALCS.
      *C   INCLUDED CENTURY ON THE COMPARISONS AND SORT OF
      *C   LAST INVENTORIED DATE.

