028900
029000 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA DATA-LINE.
029100 START-UP SECTION.
029200 HOUSEKEEPING.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
9406CK     CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.

029300     MOVE "TRPTDUIN" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN INPUT MSTORERM-I DDESC-I MPLTINFO-I.

029800     MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
029900     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
030000     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO PRT-DATE.
030100     MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO PRT-TIME.
045700     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO CUR-DATE.
           IF CUR-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO CUR-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO CUR-DATE-CC.
030200
030300 1-GET-SELECTION.
      *----- CALL CCRTFILE TO CREATE A TEMPORARY FILE FOR SORTING
      *----- LIBRARY 'QTEMP' IS USED FOR TEMPORARY FILES
           MOVE SPACES        TO CCRTFILE-PARMS.
           MOVE "QTEMP"       TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY.
           MOVE "SORTED"      TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           MOVE "0075"        TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH.
           MOVE "90000"       TO CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS.
           MOVE "02000"       TO CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT.
           MOVE "10"          TO CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS.
           CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                 CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                 CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                 CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                 CCRTFILE-STATUS.
           IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "CCRTFILE CREATE OF 'SORTED' FAILED"
                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
031600     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
031700     MOVE CHAR-1636PI     TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
031800     MOVE CHAR-10PI       TO NORMAL-PRINT.
031900     MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-61  TO ESC-TEXT-61.
           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"       TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
028100     MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES TO OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           MOVE "MCPRT"      TO OVRPRTF-FILE.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.
021100     OPEN OUTPUT DISC-PRT.
021900*----------  PRINT HEADER PAGE
022100     MOVE "DHDR80.PUB" TO HD-FILE-NAME.
022200     CALL "THDPRT2" USING HD-RET-CODE, HD-FILE-NAME,
022300        FNUM, HD-ROUTE-DATA, ESC-NAME.
022400     IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
022500          NEXT SENTENCE
022600     ELSE
022700         WRITE PRINT-REC FROM COMPRESS-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0
022800         WRITE PRINT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-61 AFTER ADVANCING 0.
022900     IF HD-RET-CODE NOT = 0
023000         DISPLAY "THDRPT ERROR".
023200
032000
050500     MOVE "P 01"         TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
033300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
033400         MOVE "DBGET ERR MPLTINFO HSK" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
033500         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
033600
033700**************************************
033800**   IF UC, WE WANT STR-CLASS       **
033900**   HEADER, OTHERWISE NOT.         **
034000**************************************
034100
034200     IF MPLTINFO-COMPANY = "129"
034300         MOVE "CLASS" TO CLASS-HDR.
034400
      *----------  COMPUTE TODAY'S JULIAN DATE
           MOVE SPACES TO J-JULIANX.
034500     CALL "JULGREG" USING CUR-DATE-CN, J-JULIANX
                                DAY-DIGIT LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
034700     MOVE J-JULIANX    TO   TODAYS-JULIAN DATE-WANTED-JULIAN.

035200 PHYS-INV-TBL-HSK.
035300     MOVE SPACES                 TO   PHYS-INV-DATE-TABLE.
035500     MOVE 365                    TO   PI-DAYS (6).
035600     SUBTRACT 1                  FROM DW-CCYY.
035700     MOVE DATE-WANTED-JULIAN     TO   PI-DD (6).
035800
035900     MOVE 30   TO PI-DAYS (1).
036000     MOVE 60   TO PI-DAYS (2).
036100     MOVE 90   TO PI-DAYS (3).
036200     MOVE 180  TO PI-DAYS (4).
036300     MOVE 360  TO PI-DAYS (5).
036400
036500     MOVE 0 TO PI.
036600
036700**************************************************************
036800**   IN ORDER TO AVOID THOUSANDS OF CALLS TO "GREGORIANDATE"**
036900**   A TABLE IS SET UP WITH THE MOST COMMON INVENTORY CYCLES**
037000**  (30, 90, 180, AND 360).  FOR EACH CYCLE, WE CALCULATE   **
037100**  THE DATE THAT MANY DAYS AGO FROM TODAY (IE. 30 DAYS     **
037200**  AGO, 90 DAYS AGO, ETC.).  THEN, COMPARING THIS CALCUL-  **
037300**  ATED DATE TO LAST INVENTORY DATE, WE CAN DETERMINE      **
037400**  WHETHER THE ITEM IS TO BE INVENTORIED.                  **
037500**************************************************************
037600
037700 STACK-PI-TABLE.
037800     ADD 1 TO PI.
037900     IF PI > 5
038000         GO TO TBL-IS-STACKED.
038100
038600     MOVE TODAYS-JULIAN TO DATE-WANTED-JULIAN.
038700     IF PI-DAYS (PI) < DW-DDD
038800         SUBTRACT PI-DAYS (PI) FROM DW-DDD
038900     ELSE
039000         ADD 365 TO DW-DDD
039100         SUBTRACT 1 FROM DW-CCYY
039200         SUBTRACT PI-DAYS (PI) FROM DW-DDD.
039300
           MOVE SPACES TO PI-DD(PI).
           MOVE DATE-WANTED-JULIAN TO J-JULIANX.
039400     CALL "JULGREG" USING PI-DD(PI) J-JULIANX
                                DAY-DIGIT LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
040100
040200     GO TO STACK-PI-TABLE.
040300
040400 TBL-IS-STACKED.
040500
040600     ADD 1 TO I.
040700     IF I < 10
040800        GO TO TBL-IS-STACKED.

           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           START MSTORERM-I KEY IS GREATER OR EQUAL
                    CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              GO TO 2-SHUTDOWN-DB.
040900
041000     SORT SORT-FILE
041100       ON ASCENDING KEY      SORT-WORK-DATE-CN
041200                             SORT-CODE
041300          INPUT  PROCEDURE IS  ABSTRACT-LOOP  THRU AC-X
041400          OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS  WRITE-REPORT THRU WR-X.
041500
041600 2-SHUTDOWN-DB.
041700     CLOSE DDESC-I MSTORERM-I MPLTINFO-I.
042100 2-STOP-RUN.
042200     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-61  AFTER ADVANCING 0.
042300     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM NORMAL-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.
042400     CLOSE DISC-PRT.
042500     GOBACK.
042600
042700 2-BLOWUP.
042800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
042900         VIEW-COMAREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
043000         BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
043100
043200 2-BLOWUP-X.
043300     EXIT.
043400
