043600*                                         *
043700*    I N P U T    P R O C E D U R E       *
043800*                                         *
043900*******************************************
044000
044300 ABSTRACT-LOOP.
044400
044500*** SERIAL GET THRU MSTORERM FOR CODES
044600
044700*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-STOREROOM, MODE2, STATUS-AREA,
044800*            ALL-ITEM-LIST, BUF-MSTORERM, CODE-ARG.

           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ MSTORERM-I NEXT INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
             MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
044900
045000*** END OF SEGMENT (MODE2) GIVES A COND-CODE OF "11"
045100
045200     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
045400             GO TO AC-X.
045800
045900*************************************************
046000**   IF UNION CITY, WE WANT TO SEE STR-CLASS,  **
046100**   OTHERWISE NOT.                            **
046200*************************************************
046300
046400     IF MPLTINFO-COMPANY  NOT = "129"
046500         MOVE SPACES TO STR-CLASS.
046600
046700 DOES-CODE-QUALIFY.
046800*************************************************
046900**   IF THE PHYSICAL INVENTORY CYCLE IS 9999,  **
047000**   THE CODE IS A NON-INVENTORY ITEM.         **
047100*************************************************
047200
047300     IF STR-PHY-INV-CYL = "9999"
047400       GO TO ABSTRACT-LOOP.
047500
047600*****************************************************
047700*                                                   *
047800*    IF ONHAND IS ZEROS, CODE AUTOMATICALLY IS TO   *
047900*      GO ON INVENTORY LISTING. LAST PHY INV DATE   *
048000*      WILL READ "ONHAND=0".                        *
048100*                                                   *
048200*    THERE ARE 2 EXCEPTIONS TO THIS RULE:           *
048300*      1.  IF THE LAST DATE OF ACTIVITY IS THE      *
048400*          SAME AS THE LAST INVENTORY DATE, DO      *
048500*          NOT PRINT.                               *
048600*      2.  IF LAST INVENTORY DATE IS NOT AT         *
048700*          LEAST 60 DAYS OLD, DO NOT PRINT.         *
048800*                                                   *
048900*****************************************************
049000     MOVE SPACES          TO SORT-RCD.
049100     MOVE STR-INV-DATE-CN TO SORT-WORK-DATE-CN.
049200
049300     IF STR-ONHAND = ZEROS
049400       IF STR-INV-DATE-CN = STR-ACT-DATE-CN
049500         GO TO ABSTRACT-LOOP
049600       ELSE
049700         MOVE 2               TO  PI
049800         MOVE LOW-VALUES      TO  SORT-WORK-DATE-CN
049900         GO TO FOUND-MATCH.
050000
050100**************************************************
050200**   IF THE ITEMS INVENTORY CYCLE IS ON OUR     **
050300**   TABLE, SKIP THE CALL TO "GREGORIANDATE"    **
050400**   AND  USE THE GREGORIAN  DATE FROM THE TABLE**
050500**************************************************
050600
050700     MOVE 0 TO PI.
050800 SEARCH-TABLE.
050900     ADD 1 TO PI.
051000     IF PI > 5
051100         GO TO DERIVE-INV-DATE.
051200     IF PI-DAYS (PI) = STR-PHY-INV-CYL-9
051300         GO TO FOUND-MATCH.
051400     GO TO SEARCH-TABLE.
051500
051600 DERIVE-INV-DATE.
051700
051800**************************************************************
051900**   FOR CYCLES NOT ON OUR TABLE, CALCULATE THE GREGORIAN   **
052000**   DATE.  THIS PROC WILL CALCULATE THE DATE X NUMBER OF   **
052100**   DAYS AGO FOR ANY CYCLE FROM 0 TO 9998.                 **
052200**                                                          **
052300**   NOTE THAT ON A STRANGE INV CYCLE LIKE 9999 (ABOUT 28   **
052400**   YEARS), THE CALCULATED DATE WILL BE OFF BY A FEW DAYS  **
052500**    DUE TO LEAP YEARS.                                    **
052600**************************************************************
052700
052800
053300     MOVE TODAYS-JULIAN          TO DATE-WANTED-JULIAN.
053400     IF STR-PHY-INV-CYL-9 < DW-DDD
053500         SUBTRACT STR-PHY-INV-CYL-9 FROM DW-DDD
053600     ELSE
053700         MOVE 0 TO YR-COUNT
053800         MOVE DW-DDD TO SAVE-JULIAN
053900         PERFORM CALCULATE-PREV-JULIAN THRU CPJ-X.
054000
           MOVE SPACES TO CALC-INV-DATE-CN.
           MOVE DATE-WANTED-JULIAN TO J-JULIANX.
           CALL "JULGREG" USING CALC-INV-DATE-CN J-JULIANX
                                DAY-DIGIT LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
054800     GO TO DOES-CODE-QUAL-FOR-INV.
054900
055000 FOUND-MATCH.
055100     MOVE PI-DD (PI) TO CALC-INV-DATE-CN.
055200*    IF IT IS CALCULATED AND FOUND THAT CODE IS     *
055300*      OVERDUE TO BE INVENTORIED (PAST OR TODAY)    *
055400*      IT WILL BE INCLUDED ON PHYS INV REPORT       *
055500*****************************************************
055600
055700 DOES-CODE-QUAL-FOR-INV.
055800     IF CALC-INV-DATE-CN > STR-INV-DATE-CN
055900         MOVE CORP-CODE   TO SORT-CODE
056000         MOVE STR-CLASS       TO SORT-CLASS
056100         MOVE STR-PHY-INV-CYL TO SORT-INV-CYL
056200         RELEASE SORT-RCD.
056300
056400     GO TO ABSTRACT-LOOP.
056500
056600 CALCULATE-PREV-JULIAN.
056700     ADD 1 TO YR-COUNT.
056800     ADD 365 TO SAVE-JULIAN.
056900     IF SAVE-JULIAN > STR-PHY-INV-CYL-9
057000         SUBTRACT STR-PHY-INV-CYL-9 FROM SAVE-JULIAN
057100         SUBTRACT YR-COUNT FROM DW-CCYY
057200         MOVE SAVE-JULIAN TO DW-DDD
057300         GO TO CPJ-X
057400     ELSE
057500         GO TO CALCULATE-PREV-JULIAN.
057600 CPJ-X.
057700     EXIT.
057800
057900 AC-X.
058000     EXIT.
058100
058200*******************************************
058300*                                         *
058400*                                         *
058500*    O U T P U T   P R O C E D U R E      *
058600*                                         *
058700*******************************************
058800
058900
059000 WRITE-REPORT SECTION.
059100 WRITE-RPT.
059200     IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
059300         NEXT SENTENCE
059400     ELSE
059500         WRITE PRINT-REC FROM COMPRESS-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0
059600         WRITE PRINT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-61 AFTER ADVANCING 0.
059700     MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-REC.
059800     PERFORM RETURN-RCD.
059900     IF EOF-SW = "Y"             GO TO  WR-X.
060000
060100
060200     MOVE 0 TO PG-CTR.
060300     MOVE PRT-TIME TO PRT-INV-TIME.
060400     MOVE PRT-DATE TO PRT-DT-OF-INV
060500                      PRT-INV-DT.
060600     MOVE 51 TO ITMS-PER-PAGE.
060700
060800
060900*******************************************
061000*                                         *
061100*    T O   B E   I N V E N T O R I E D    *
061200*                                         *
061300*******************************************
061400
061500 62-PHYS-INV.
061600     IF ITMS-PER-PAGE > 50
061700         MOVE 1 TO ITMS-PER-PAGE
061800         PERFORM 622-PRT-PHYS-INV-TOP.
061900
062000     MOVE SORT-CODE          TO  PRT-INV-CD.
062100     IF SORT-WORK-DATE-CN = LOW-VALUES
062200       MOVE "ONHAND=0"       TO  PRT-INV-DATE
062300     ELSE
062400       MOVE SORT-WORK-DATE   TO  UNEDITED-DATE
062500       MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
062600       MOVE SORT-WORK-DATE   TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN
062700       CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
062800       MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT   TO  PRT-INV-DATE.
062900     MOVE SORT-CLASS         TO PRT-CLASS.
063000     IF SORT-INV-CYL = 180
063100         MOVE SPACES         TO PRT-INV-CYL
063200     ELSE
063300         MOVE SORT-INV-CYL   TO EDIT-INV-CYL
063400         MOVE EDIT-INV-CYL   TO PRT-INV-CYL.
063500
063600     MOVE SORT-CODE          TO  CODE-ARG.
063700*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DESC, MODE1, STATUS-AREA,
063800*            CODE-SEARCH, CODE-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF DDESC-REC-I.
           START DDESC-I KEY = CORPCDE OF DDESC-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
063900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
064000         MOVE "* NO DESCRIPTION ON FILE *" TO PRT-INV-DESC
064100         GO TO 621-CONT.
064200
064300*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DESC, MODE5, STATUS-AREA,
064400*            ALL-ITEM-LIST, BUF-DDESC, CODE-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DDESC-I NEXT INTO BUF-DDESC
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF CORPCDE OF DDESC-REC-I NOT = CODE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
064500     IF COND-WORD = 0
064600         MOVE DESC-DATA      TO  PRT-INV-DESC
064700     ELSE
064800         MOVE "* NO DESCRIPTION ON FILE *" TO PRT-INV-DESC.
064900
065000 621-CONT.
065100     MOVE INV-HDR-5          TO  PRINT-REC.
065200     MOVE 1                  TO  LINE-ADV.
065300     WRITE PRINT-REC BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
065400     ADD 1 TO ITMS-PER-PAGE.
065500     GO TO 623-CONT.
065600
065700 622-PRT-PHYS-INV-TOP.
065800     MOVE SPACES             TO  PRINT-REC.
065900     WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
066000     ADD 1 TO PG-CTR.
066100     MOVE PG-CTR             TO  PRT-INV-PG.
066200     MOVE 2                  TO  LINE-ADV.
066300     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM INV-HDR-1 BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
066400     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM INV-HDR-2 BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
066500     MOVE 1                  TO  LINE-ADV.
066600     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM INV-HDR-3 BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
066700     MOVE 2                  TO  LINE-ADV.
066800     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM INV-HDR-4
066900          BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
067000
067100 623-CONT.
067200     PERFORM RETURN-RCD.
067300     IF EOF-SW = "N"
067400         GO TO 62-PHYS-INV.
067500     GO TO WR-X.
067600
067700 62-X.
067800     EXIT.
067900
       COPY OVRPFCALL OF COPYLIB.
068000
068100 99-CALL-DBEXPLAIN.
068200     CALL "DBEXPLAIN" USING STATUS-AREA.
068300
068400  RETURN-RCD.
068500         RETURN SORT-FILE
068600             AT END MOVE SPACES TO SORT-RCD
068700                    MOVE "Y" TO EOF-SW.
068800 WR-X.
068900     EXIT.
